description	"LT. Grenn

Chief of the TSF.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- TSF Riot Stun Baton (Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Staggers/Pulses on hit
-- 10% more Kb
-- 50% less Reach
-- 33% more Radius
- TSF Issue Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 25% Faster RoF
-- Mag Reload
- TSF Security Rifle
-- DLT-20A (3)
-- 35%+ Damage, 10%- RoF, 10%+ Velocity
- Suppression Cannon 
-- Minigun (2)
-- Cripples/Poisons/Slips/Force Focuses/Tracks
-- Mag Reload
-- 10% Less Damage/FP Drain
- Perimeter Sensor Explosive
-- Tripmine (3)
-- Tracks
- Cryoban Containment Grenade (2)
-- Sonic Grenade, Freezes

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Rally
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stamina (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Environmential Protection (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Strength (1)
- Sentry Gun
- Seeker Drone

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3 Weapon Out]
- Containment Darts (Tracking Darts 6) ^3[CS3 Melee]
-- Freezes On Hit
- Pet Control ^3[CS2]
- Grappling Hook (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS4 Weapon Out]"
